    "색을 구별하기 어려워도 칸마다 어떤 하늘인지 알아볼 수 있어요." : {
      "comment" : "Roadmap item detail: contrast and color",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tell which sky each square holds, even if colors are hard to tell apart."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tell which sky each square holds, even if colours are hard to tell apart."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aunque cueste distinguir los colores, sabrás qué cielo guarda cada casilla."
